p load-balance partitions between members."},"1997":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples-8","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples#typed-messages","content":"A typed publisher/consumer pair that (de)serializes a record as JSON. Note that the typed builders are configured via statements rather than one fluent chain — the With* methods return the untyped base builder, so Build() must be called on the typed builder variable (see Typed consumer):"},"1998":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples-9","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples#more-examples","content":"The examples/csharp directory in the Iggy repository contains complete, runnable projects:"},"1999":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples-10","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples#more-examples","content":"Basic / GettingStarted — low-level producer and consumer"},"2000":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples-11","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples#more-examples","content":"NewSdk — high-level IggyPublisher / IggyConsumer (like the samples above)"},"2001":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples-12","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples#more-examples","content":"MessageEnvelope — envelope pattern (message type + JSON payload) over the low-level client"},"2002":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples-13","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples#more-examples","content":"MessageHeaders — user-defined message headers"},"2003":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples-14","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/examples#more-examples","content":"TcpTls — TLS-encrypted TCP connection"},"2004":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","type":"page","content":"Gui