ocs/sdk/csharp/guide#message-encryption","content":"With an encryptor configured, polling with autoCommit: true throws InvalidOperationException by default: the server commits the offset before the client decrypts, so a decryption failure would silently skip the whole batch. Poll with autoCommit: false and store offsets after processing, or opt in with AllowAutoCommitWithEncryptor = true. This guard does not affect the high-level IggyConsumer commit modes."},"2154":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide-149","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide#message-encryption","content":"On the high-level builders, WithEncryptor(...) is only valid when the builder creates its own client; for an external client, set MessageEncryptor on the configurator instead."},"2155":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide-150","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide#connection-events","content":"Subscribe to connection state changes — useful for reacting to reconnects (e.g. rejoining a consumer group):"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide-151","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide#identifiers","content":"Streams, topics, users, and consumer groups are referenced by an Identifier, which can be either numeric or a name:"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide-152","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide#user-login","content":"Begin with the root account (iggy / iggy):"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide-153","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide#creating-users","content":"Create new users with customizable permissions:"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide-154","page_id":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdk/csharp/guide#creating-users","content":"Besides Global, Permissions.Streams scopes permissions to specific streams (keyed by nu